<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech JCE 9mo gross profit eases.</title>
<headline>Czech JCE 9mo gross profit eases.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results for nine-month period ending September 30, 1996, according to Czech accounting standards (in millions of crowns):</p>
<p> gross profit	    223.757	 vs	 231.547</p>
<p> operating profit	210.600	 vs	 216.146</p>
<p>sales of own goods</p>
<p>  and services	 3,547.568	 vs     3,335.425</p>
<p> assets		  7,261.618	 vs     4,534.250</p>
<p> basic capital	 1,916.408	 vs     1,916.408</p>
<p>Note. Full company name is Jihoceska Energetika a.s., a regional power distributor based in Ceske Budejovice.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
